    "title": "GameSir T4 Mini Bluetooth Gyro controller gamepad for Nintendo Switch, Apple Arcade, iOS, Android, PC, Semi transparent black / white",
    "body_html": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4gqCgDCUQZM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8CVCzNt0Et8fjQm157L37fsTSOag9l6huoRrC8ZvT9Pj3yIh9cDZDLgKoVO9JE7VAEaXDHiXEnHKNvmV1OdIoW1i5kXMSKC-Mt_sDHqw8G3D-7UU2exBs6xJt578RO4r4NjVMuRavbjcgXdGF42eutn=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8Bgk6pSaQr-h23zM-gC2jUPtXvW_hXaTyMvWxe2Tl7D5b68qSq_uVO-CFJ8SIpz-WVwj70_ln0LD61SlSZJN_l2uHHnnIQqqhk49w-yOp3MuvbA7dYOpweG_HEfI4MdamaswpR-GePRSOtmskF5yiZs=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8Bgk6pSaQr-h23zM-gC2jUPtXvW_hXaTyMvWxe2Tl7D5b68qSq_uVO-CFJ8SIpz-WVwj70_ln0LD61SlSZJN_l2uHHnnIQqqhk49w-yOp3MuvbA7dYOpweG_HEfI4MdamaswpR-GePRSOtmskF5yiZs=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8DKFqTaPSWQTAU2wj-u6llck5z7G1F7Kqa6tFVHDpGg9HpD_f7pAulVYrtGslTcMi1aEhvzil9VOWEva3ekeIeLwI6jToxBILdIGAwO7AyPqE7fFue3d3nGJSKWQdHk3Fggaw_rj5F1eS-Q7fXiFxmn=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8DKFqTaPSWQTAU2wj-u6llck5z7G1F7Kqa6tFVHDpGg9HpD_f7pAulVYrtGslTcMi1aEhvzil9VOWEva3ekeIeLwI6jToxBILdIGAwO7AyPqE7fFue3d3nGJSKWQdHk3Fggaw_rj5F1eS-Q7fXiFxmn=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8CHo8uUDZzueASWiDR8afmWDLuzoRBdIVbKzH0vjuw4jLSjQ32sgy1SDtniSrTunMAozI8mf8sw9T4lWbutMxrmUlARHtJ200GBGzmlkbDUzXWnGr1c3eBLTLtNNdA3tNPrJxHrmsQoZsGgDUjPGhGK=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8CHo8uUDZzueASWiDR8afmWDLuzoRBdIVbKzH0vjuw4jLSjQ32sgy1SDtniSrTunMAozI8mf8sw9T4lWbutMxrmUlARHtJ200GBGzmlkbDUzXWnGr1c3eBLTLtNNdA3tNPrJxHrmsQoZsGgDUjPGhGK=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"></span></strong></p>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8AgqiKqty6cUp5BwntylrHiXYRrGZ2ug5084AiZhxvj0jZARrTBzlNMqbu48vcFjgABNDrPJyYbjWTtEJVD8SinOQpRXNvPg8BC-M4PJTtPeSZefcLsnFmKNfbLOJIJf4thEdaRF81VPRSnp1dHozVn=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8AgqiKqty6cUp5BwntylrHiXYRrGZ2ug5084AiZhxvj0jZARrTBzlNMqbu48vcFjgABNDrPJyYbjWTtEJVD8SinOQpRXNvPg8BC-M4PJTtPeSZefcLsnFmKNfbLOJIJf4thEdaRF81VPRSnp1dHozVn=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XND9r-_RCKI\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n<h1>SPECIFICATIONS</h1>\n<p>Working Platforms: Nintendo Switch / Android / iOS / Windows PC</p>\n<p>Wireless Technology: Bluetooth 5.0</p>\n<p>Wake up Switch Console: Yes</p>\n<p>Vibration Motors: Yes</p>\n<p>Type: Gamepads</p>\n<p>Trigger Button Type: Non-Linear</p>\n<p>T Button (Turbo Button): Yes</p>\n<p>Six Axis Gyroscope: Yes</p>\n<p>Screenshot Button: Yes</p>\n<p>Package: Yes</p>\n<p>Origin: Mainland China</p>\n<p>Model Number: T4 Mini\u00a0</p>\n<p>Joystick Sensor Module Brand: POLYSHINE\u00a0</p>\n<p>Interface Type: USB,bluetooth</p>\n<p>GameSir Model: T4 Mini</p>\n<p>Connectivity: Type-C</p>\n<p>Connection: Wireless / Wired</p>\n<p>Compatible Platform: Nintendo Switch,PC,Android,IOS,STEAM</p>\n<p>Compatible Nintendo Model: Nintendo Switch,Nintendo Switch Lite</p>\n<p>Compatible Brand/Model: Nintendo</p>\n<p>Certification: CE,FCC,RoHS</p>\n<p>Brand Name: GameSir</p>\n<p>Battery Capacity: built-in 600mAh lithium battery</p>\n<p>Auto Sleep Mode: Yes</p>\n<p>\u00a0<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX3XZFzKiUM8_k6vwDS8LNcQ_0G61DMV0TGQLn6DZFq3PkQbwHsvWWkOTUOZGBLfCcMuGbwZ48aNnThaKrlXFcT-3II_Ob4ESodVZzz_c6Pm8WvJSpSJeHTcOtsE8meyBSaNWOJ-Kr77fo3Je5Hslqm=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX3XZFzKiUM8_k6vwDS8LNcQ_0G61DMV0TGQLn6DZFq3PkQbwHsvWWkOTUOZGBLfCcMuGbwZ48aNnThaKrlXFcT-3II_Ob4ESodVZzz_c6Pm8WvJSpSJeHTcOtsE8meyBSaNWOJ-Kr77fo3Je5Hslqm=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Women and children are an important part of the gaming community, but most standard gamepads on the market are better suited for men's larger hands. In order to let you and your girlfriend play games sweetly, or spend a happy parent-child time with your children through games, GameSir has launched the T4 Mini gamepad, which has a compact and lightweight body design, more suitable for girls and children with small hands. Play games with the GameSir T4 Mini and the full-sized T4 Pro, and the whole family will have more fun!<br> <br> Like the GameSir T4 Pro, the T4 Mini game controller also has excellent cross-platform compatibility, allowing you to enjoy more fun on Nintendo Switch, desktop computer, laptop, Android and iOS devices. In particular, GameSir T4 Mini is perfect for multiplayer games on Nintendo Switch, it not only provides realism in the game through the built-in 6-axis gyroscope and asymmetric dual motors, but also can transmit the joyful atmosphere in the game to the real life. If you are looking for a small but powerful gaming controller for your girlfriend or kids, GameSir T4 Mini will be your first choice.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUKPyasvltzzxG_DF_LZRAH400CZ5GsUFmmxY3zH4XlVnoT8Vv8bJ4unLXEmQF_X49RGfUvIU_DdkatQYN5kLlcl4MKzrPbzcRUS6QlQ3vReZ_e_k8ptWI-A21W7kJmesLcZmedaB9ZV9nLPssgJ_OL=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUKPyasvltzzxG_DF_LZRAH400CZ5GsUFmmxY3zH4XlVnoT8Vv8bJ4unLXEmQF_X49RGfUvIU_DdkatQYN5kLlcl4MKzrPbzcRUS6QlQ3vReZ_e_k8ptWI-A21W7kJmesLcZmedaB9ZV9nLPssgJ_OL=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Mini size for women and children</p>\n<p>Too much finger travel between buttons? Lack of grip? Too bulky, especially in a long game? It's time for you to rethink the size of your gamepad and eliminate these discomforts and hassles from gaming by using GameSir T4 Mini. The small size of the T4 Mini (14.3*8.3cm / 5.63*3.27in) allows small hands to hold the controller more comfortably, reducing fatigue. Therefore, they can play bigger in the right size. What's more, the ease of use and portability of the mini controller makes it easier for the whole family to play together at home or on the go.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXA7cWvDWMkWG8T92dUQxtdQMlOo1fAOKn0o4N91rULhNqoWdw6KBwZ2fkYqYDp0IEWkcR-HKrM3Rx_cJXlZxdMtnS65Le5vTn5r_g-NCxs0JOOKEDheBk-345Q9ubVWDirPp4wLyg8DjbKZ6taCKy5=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXA7cWvDWMkWG8T92dUQxtdQMlOo1fAOKn0o4N91rULhNqoWdw6KBwZ2fkYqYDp0IEWkcR-HKrM3Rx_cJXlZxdMtnS65Le5vTn5r_g-NCxs0JOOKEDheBk-345Q9ubVWDirPp4wLyg8DjbKZ6taCKy5=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEVQxds9Vd53k01TATfrRyo7-oSTvjqF0i21RgyN4n4-1KwPdoeLnLMKmqtULXjMDPjRcykyJV0zfCMu2PcrOwW2WI86eROPEicTxxVlZD3X_I2vMWbtylSHhfRCc600PnnIx4gqxBzxWkNu88JVVpWw=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEVQxds9Vd53k01TATfrRyo7-oSTvjqF0i21RgyN4n4-1KwPdoeLnLMKmqtULXjMDPjRcykyJV0zfCMu2PcrOwW2WI86eROPEicTxxVlZD3X_I2vMWbtylSHhfRCc600PnnIx4gqxBzxWkNu88JVVpWw=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Perfect for Switch and Switch Lite for greater glory in multiplayer games</p>\n<p>GameSir T4 Mini gaming controller will go into automatic sleep mode after you turn off the Nintendo Switch console screen, making it easier to preserve battery life without having to manually shut down. At the same time, pressing the Home button on the T4 Mini wakes up the Nintendo Switch console, allowing you to easily and quickly start a new round of games at any time.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX4CV90qQfL20j_QhoAyz08LT6AKvvQ2j4K9yDVAuqGg-LjJfeBgiNjC7b74ylkdv2tsbOylkQNhjr0WPQeTYwN96pTytp3oMjP043fxkFxDTfAMjE-r9Zzw4bIQdkabwZbkfGGSmandJi3tIVUY5Cq=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX4CV90qQfL20j_QhoAyz08LT6AKvvQ2j4K9yDVAuqGg-LjJfeBgiNjC7b74ylkdv2tsbOylkQNhjr0WPQeTYwN96pTytp3oMjP043fxkFxDTfAMjE-r9Zzw4bIQdkabwZbkfGGSmandJi3tIVUY5Cq=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Make the game more real</p>\n<p>A. Equipped with a 6-axis gyro, GameSir T4 Mini allows gamers to implement or combine more motion inputs, such as tilt and rotation, for more active and immersive interactions in Switch motion-controlled games.<br> <br> B. Asymmetric dual motors produce different and non-monotonic vibration effects on the left and right grips, providing timely, combined, vivid vibration feedback, especially in racing, fighting and shooting games.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEVIggO7OJ_rbj5F357OulMhqzvkDXzd-xxKxAVirGVmmt-W4ZPsR8cm2loaDG7PfmtJhN2Nd5clpNA6SuRO4gcWL1M2WogwL72B7JJsL21w_LUkokda0Qqc6gfacr3cULe-xv6XSbSmE50texwSK4qw=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEVIggO7OJ_rbj5F357OulMhqzvkDXzd-xxKxAVirGVmmt-W4ZPsR8cm2loaDG7PfmtJhN2Nd5clpNA6SuRO4gcWL1M2WogwL72B7JJsL21w_LUkokda0Qqc6gfacr3cULe-xv6XSbSmE50texwSK4qw=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Multi-platform compatibility</p>\n<p>As mentioned at the beginning, GameSir T4 Mini is perfect for the Nintendo Switch. But it doesn't stop there. It's also widely compatible with Windows PC, Android smartphone, Android tablet, Apple iPhone, and iPad, so you can easily switch between platforms for more fun without changing the controller.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXBfVBRkip0ZjzuRLoWSwfR8WAT5syN5i5vQnGiEEdDWhk4oUxADrl9cXCkh9Qvj406tGRfphH4Jj7znOrux8nH3RQfayvSp34S05mW8yfI56kloJjOL4Ad_U60pj8twqODfjx-hYmrYd8TPnS3QaR5=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXBfVBRkip0ZjzuRLoWSwfR8WAT5syN5i5vQnGiEEdDWhk4oUxADrl9cXCkh9Qvj406tGRfphH4Jj7znOrux8nH3RQfayvSp34S05mW8yfI56kloJjOL4Ad_U60pj8twqODfjx-hYmrYd8TPnS3QaR5=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Excellent game compatibility</p>\n<p>A small body doesn't mean less features or lower performance. With GameSir T4 Mini game controller, you can easily launch MFi or Apple Arcade games on iOS mobile devices and play HID games with controller support on Android devices.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX9b-0HvtvMLcBljtDZ9_CFJeU0N1u-2ObeP0-7CijaKskNvp3IOX-9p3ClZsSVpv9sS5Vls8ipUDFHWO9A-x6jjX6-vqwyLs7BXj-y1SLVEEAn1gzLJDlKMbDf_0NR6VPLl0VfCP2ZzvzXb57XEFmz=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX9b-0HvtvMLcBljtDZ9_CFJeU0N1u-2ObeP0-7CijaKskNvp3IOX-9p3ClZsSVpv9sS5Vls8ipUDFHWO9A-x6jjX6-vqwyLs7BXj-y1SLVEEAn1gzLJDlKMbDf_0NR6VPLl0VfCP2ZzvzXb57XEFmz=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>A variety of Turbo modes are very user-friendly</p>\n<p>The Turbo function enables continuous shooting action without the need for continuous keystrokes, which relieves finger fatigue and reduces wear and tear on the gamepad. GameSir T4 Mini presets a variety of flexible Turbo modes that allow you to maximize Turbo customization, including Manual Turbo, Auto Turbo, Single Key Turbo and Turbo Off. Therefore, different game players can implement different game strategies in different game scenarios, so as to achieve the ultimate game experience.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXUiZ57DBqx_EnlpIXqKr1GJ4tJ1Kr7SFyYULSdjm-8bNdIT_jfi4uJ9LY1YMv9G-U91_svhbd1qhJv8CnGgEuAMz-swAJfp0m3XSOVNlyZKEDjLNL5DXuYaml8Vs5TjdnMuoC8ESOgdSMnI9LS-Kd0=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEXUiZ57DBqx_EnlpIXqKr1GJ4tJ1Kr7SFyYULSdjm-8bNdIT_jfi4uJ9LY1YMv9G-U91_svhbd1qhJv8CnGgEuAMz-swAJfp0m3XSOVNlyZKEDjLNL5DXuYaml8Vs5TjdnMuoC8ESOgdSMnI9LS-Kd0=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<p>Adjustable backlight modes, shine in your own way</p>\n<p>You can choose from 4 backlight modes on the joystick. The customization of backlight colors and modes can create different game atmospheres in different scenes, whether it is tense or relaxed, making you more immersed in the game world.<br> <br> There is a line in Flipped that says \"But every once in a while you find someone who\u2019s iridescent, and when you do, nothing will ever compare.\" On GameSir T4 Mini, you can find rainbows in 3 ways (static / circulatory / breathing). May this bring good luck to your game.<br> <br> A. Static (9 colors available, blue, red, green, yellow, cyan, orange, purple, pink and rainbow color)<br> B. 8 colors circulatory breathing<br> C. Rainbow breathing<br> D. Off</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEW99tvtstQqN5aFkDpu6AsZvjRJc8-dDlc_hUOaiXTWqa-5HtAp-BxOa2IS7qJahXaKw7UayZBAxsxbnrkZrZXtSDDd5kcfomwXLdyR2D4OxApDH4m4foGJNZeJUbb8KBRvstLnWySMKXhNneltYsYT=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEW99tvtstQqN5aFkDpu6AsZvjRJc8-dDlc_hUOaiXTWqa-5HtAp-BxOa2IS7qJahXaKw7UayZBAxsxbnrkZrZXtSDDd5kcfomwXLdyR2D4OxApDH4m4foGJNZeJUbb8KBRvstLnWySMKXhNneltYsYT=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p>Long battery life, endless fun</p>\n<p>A full charge of GameSir T4 Mini takes about 3 hours. Built-in 600mAh lithium battery allows you to keep the game for about 10 hours. In addition, the power saving design of automatic sleep mode reduces battery consumption and longer gaming fun.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUYm97In0HmQrbk6tLFbf1d5J4WWFDB0ObgVJGxBAKuHOjeGS-TLmh4f0s3_wCOk5toJA1ZgzuxrTxa5zkPIhfe_qWl83ulU9IV_dfcXfvfbG4RciRS8Wnj_uYp_vDBkY9B5-nT14sN7MoUGMLYeQOZ=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUYm97In0HmQrbk6tLFbf1d5J4WWFDB0ObgVJGxBAKuHOjeGS-TLmh4f0s3_wCOk5toJA1ZgzuxrTxa5zkPIhfe_qWl83ulU9IV_dfcXfvfbG4RciRS8Wnj_uYp_vDBkY9B5-nT14sN7MoUGMLYeQOZ=s1000-no?authuser=2\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUhCrgl_qDFLI-P_zsd_r4eYfBWqByyDI4xuXaLE_Z2EAEjXmBHkxTDXdcuI3OQo-gpfFu23Um_mLL7nF7LOp6wj0zd61wU5px9E0QeJlvPIzrmaR1J0r8gvXQxTARBBpGsAC67P29OtAbp6rtgZzsG=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX-9BXUffre6yINnhOwAr92eFmvgcec7HY310xcVQjbSNWcH-zW7ZLybm-vfY8QUylDdWIHAP0SPTO-cd5J77jzZ2EBL_T6bOCqiLH-WqQX9bofsZ5rHjAqwGnvC-BWd-usRuaOWs1hOGMvX5Oi95GB=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEX-9BXUffre6yINnhOwAr92eFmvgcec7HY310xcVQjbSNWcH-zW7ZLybm-vfY8QUylDdWIHAP0SPTO-cd5J77jzZ2EBL_T6bOCqiLH-WqQX9bofsZ5rHjAqwGnvC-BWd-usRuaOWs1hOGMvX5Oi95GB=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUu-tPokVOIeL9NdjSXBnTKPTOZgMAOfuTp3KdGLez9AwKBf1FGmbJTIseK7cNNtiHtyabZmuX7lrIkYCJB1GtDAc-D8e212S65A94PNB2HF-LkyPUYpcF8rJ9nW8jVZd4RVvvZkRz0lUlPPoSc4fKH=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEUu-tPokVOIeL9NdjSXBnTKPTOZgMAOfuTp3KdGLez9AwKBf1FGmbJTIseK7cNNtiHtyabZmuX7lrIkYCJB1GtDAc-D8e212S65A94PNB2HF-LkyPUYpcF8rJ9nW8jVZd4RVvvZkRz0lUlPPoSc4fKH=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEWaTeCFc8ZwkBr1yS2OWc-yRdNjHW5WomFivXSewpYYdyObrmSe9oo_wRMlp3WHTFUJmsBNo0Lg15_udadip0t43BtB9XrLDHkXgvn1RdeX06EOMKApPftQaEA_Dj2vmncmFSkrX4z1BoGhEknFhggV=s1000-no?authuser=2\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AL9nZEWaTeCFc8ZwkBr1yS2OWc-yRdNjHW5WomFivXSewpYYdyObrmSe9oo_wRMlp3WHTFUJmsBNo0Lg15_udadip0t43BtB9XrLDHkXgvn1RdeX06EOMKApPftQaEA_Dj2vmncmFSkrX4z1BoGhEknFhggV=s1000-no?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https:/